abstract: >
  Morocco Economic Intelligence Lab is an open research initiative dedicated to
  producing data-driven economic analyses, sector intelligence, and policy-oriented
  studies on the Moroccan economy. This repository contains reproducible research,
  datasets, Python notebooks, executive summaries, and visualizations.

